        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo 1846, ADA Compliant Stainless Steel Cup Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis 5\" x 5\" ADA flush pull can be used for residential, industrial or commercial doors. Durable and sturdy for many years of everyday use. For use with sliding or swinging doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- <p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-1850_size.gif?v=1704354498\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo 1850 Stainless Flush Cup Pull  size\">\r\n</p> -->\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe cup pulls lip projects outward 3/8\" for easy grasp. They are thru-bolt mounted with 4 #10-24 x 5/8\" security Torx head machine screws and 4 one way x 5/8\" sex nuts. <br>\r\n*Requires minimum 2\" thick door for back to back mounting.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Don-Jo 1846-630 ADA Cup Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Height: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Width: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Depth: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Depth: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Minimum of 1 3/4\" Door Thickness Required</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Width: 4-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Height: 4-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Cup Opening Width: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Cup Opening Height: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Cup Opening Depth: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish:  630 Brushed Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with Installation Hardware</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/1846.pdf?v=1704262296\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo 1846 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold individually (with installation hardware).</b>\r\n</p>",
