                "description": "Don-Jo 1846 flush cup pull. This 5 x 5 ADA compliant stainless steel cup pull can be used for residential, industrial or commercial doors. Durable and sturdy for many years of everyday use. For use with sliding or swinging doors. The cup pulls lip projects outward 3/8 for easy grasp. They are thru-bolt mounted with 4 #10-24 x 5/8 security Torx head machine screws and 4 one way x 5/8 sex nuts. ",
